# Ashiok, Dream Render: an opponent can't choose to search either ("you may search your library ... then shuffle", the
# 2019-05-03 ruling: they can't choose to, so they won't shuffle). Environmental Scientist's enters trigger asks "may search
# for a basic land" and is answered Accept. Bot2's, on turn 2 under Ashiok, is not asked (the refusal) and fetches no
# Forest (its hand stays at five) and shuffles nothing (its library keeps its order: if it had searched, it would be shuffled); Bot1's own on turn 3 is asked, finds the Forest and puts it into its hand (the control).

